<p>You invoke a long standing pact with a fellow horror, a Worm that Walks, to help you in your travels.</p><p>You can fully control, level, and equip it.</p><p>Using this spell will ressurect your friendly horror if it died, giving it back <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">48%, 62%, 73%, 82%, 90%</acronym> life.</p><p>Higher raw talent levels will give your horror more equipment slots:</p><p><li>Level 1:  Mainhand, Offhand</li><li>Level 2:  Body</li><li>Level 3:  Belt</li><li>Level 4:  Ring, Ring</li><li>Level 5:  Ring, Ring, Trinket</li></ul><p></p><p>To change your horror's equipment and talents first transfer the equipment from your inventory then take control of it.</p>